{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"alias":"nonlineal-crotchety-galago","creation_channel":"mcp","description":"## Context / Problem\nThe tests/unit/plan_review cohort contains audited comments or docstrings that obscure current behavior with repetition, obvious narration, duplicated explanation, or historical detail. The audit is pinned to `9e65567b79ffe872534c3c656ade7b34340d8192`.\n\n## Approach\nEdit explanatory text only in this directory/subsystem cohort. Condense it to current, non-obvious rationale and constraints; retain every file-specific preserve item and consumer contract below. Grouping adjacent files from one subsystem keeps the change reviewable in one session and permits one coherent verification pass without changing executable behavior.\n\n## Scope\n- `tests/unit/plan_review/test_2be7_whitespace_material.py:1-23, 119-124, 165-169` — Preserve insignificant-whitespace normalization, meaningful-edit invalidation, and legacy fingerprint compatibility. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/plan_review/test_94a3_material_diff.py:1-17` — Preserve component-specific diagnostics, checkbox normalization, legacy handling, and unchanged gate outcome. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/plan_review/test_criteria_blocking.py:1-21` — Preserve thresholds, blocking posture, and T10 routing controls. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/plan_review/test_det_criterion_gates.py:1-17` — Preserve deterministic trigger arms, skip evidence, and existing-criterion behavior. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/plan_review/test_det_floor_module_seam.py:1-40, 54-55, 64-65, 75-76, 97-102` — Preserve moved-symbol ownership, compatibility re-exports, dependency bindings, acyclicity, ordering, and size headroom. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/plan_review/test_g7_blocking.py:1-20, 85-87` — Preserve 0.85 boundary, grade mapping, and rubric constraints. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/plan_review/test_t5c_grounding.py:1-23, 82-84` — Preserve grounding override, deduplication, demotion, and severity scoping. Consumer: none found.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Every listed location contains only current, non-obvious rationale or constraints after remediation; verified by reviewing the final diff against every Scope row.\n- [ ] Every preserve item and consumer contract in Scope remains explicit and accurate; verified by a row-by-row completion comment and the commands under Verification.\n- [ ] No executable behavior or test assertion changes; verified by the commands under Verification exiting 0.\n\n## Verification\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make lint`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" .venv/bin/python scripts/check_comment_hygiene.py`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" pytest tests/unit/plan_review/test_2be7_whitespace_material.py tests/unit/plan_review/test_94a3_material_diff.py tests/unit/plan_review/test_criteria_blocking.py tests/unit/plan_review/test_det_criterion_gates.py tests/unit/plan_review/test_det_floor_module_seam.py tests/unit/plan_review/test_g7_blocking.py tests/unit/plan_review/test_t5c_grounding.py`\n\nThe row-by-row diff review is authoritative for prose quality; the hygiene guard detects only its narrow deterministic history-token rule.","id":"51fb-a3b6-ac66-4c60","parent_id":"ae4d-df34-480d-4c88","priority":3,"repos":["rebar"],"tags":["comments","documentation","maintainability","grouped-remediation"],"ticket_type":"task","title":"Condense comments in tests/unit/plan_review"},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1788571897244550782,"uuid":"2a3bb1ed-e908-46a1-bc07-d5b79096ba63"}